      "writtenOn": "2021-01-06T12:21:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think if the capport info only has a refresh time, not using it is the right choice as it doesn\u0027t reflect the refresh time of anything: it\u0027s better to keep the refresh time of the information that is here (the NA provided info).",
      "parentUuid": "c6a6005d_6f792422",
      "range": {
