      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-12-24T01:56:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "...which is unnecessary, because it prevents a no-op :) (and in fact, it\u0027s likely slower because of branch prediction)\n\nBut no strong opinion.",
      "parentUuid": "cf8ebde5_8fabd7ad",
      "range": {
